Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久以前，在一个遥远的银河中…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:45.35,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星球大战：帝国反击战》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.56,0:00:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于反抗军来说，这是一个黑暗的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.26,0:00:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然死星已经被摧毁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.43,0:01:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国部队把反抗军逼出了他们的秘密基地，并且在银河中苦苦追赶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了躲避丧心病狂的帝国舰队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.94,0:01:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,一队自由战士在天行者卢克的带领下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在遥远的霍斯星系的冰天雪地中建立了一个秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:22.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的达斯·维德勋爵为了找到年轻的天行者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,派出了几千个探测机器人，其魔掌遍布整个银河
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.63,0:03:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,三号呼叫七号\N{\fnArial\fs30}EchoThree to Echo Seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉，老伙计，能听到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han, old buddy, do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.72,0:03:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很清楚，小子，怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loud and clear, kid. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.89,0:03:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我转完一圈了，没发现任何生命迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I finished my circle. I don't pick up any life readings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.69,0:03:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里冰天雪地的，没有那么多生命体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't enough life on this ice cube to fill a space cruiser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.73,0:03:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,传感器已经安装完毕，我正在返程\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sensors are placed. I'm going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.65,0:03:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，等会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ri ght. I'll see you shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,一颗流星在附近坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a meteorite that hit the ground near here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过去察看一下，不会太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to check it out. It won't take long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.20,0:03:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.66,0:03:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住，怎么了？你闻到什么了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady, girl. What's the matter? You smell something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，楚伊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie. Chewie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事，别发脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Don't lose your temper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.26,0:04:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就过来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come right back and give you a hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.28,0:05:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,索罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.45,0:05:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没发现生命迹象，将军，传感器已经就位\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of life out there, General. The sensors are in place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果有什么东西，我们会发现的 - 天行者指挥官回来了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll know if anything comes around. - Commander Skywalker reported in yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，他去检查一颗在他附近坠落的流星了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He's checking out a meteorite that hit near him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于流星的原因，对入侵战舰的探测可能受到影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all the meteor activity, it's gonna be difficult to spot approaching ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军，我要走了，我不能呆在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, I gotta leave. I can't stay any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.84,0:05:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真遗憾 - 有人悬赏捉拿我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry to hear that. - There's a price on my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.80,0:05:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不还钱给赫特族的贾巴，我就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't pay offJabba the Hutt, I'm a dead man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.26,0:05:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,被人追杀可不好过\N{\fnArial\fs30}A death mark's not an easy thing to live with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一名优秀的战士，索罗，我可不想失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good fighter, Solo. I hate to lose you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.31,0:05:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖，将军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thankyou, General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.86,0:05:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩，殿下，就这样了，是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Your Highness, guess this is it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.70,0:06:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要总是对我这么冷淡，再见，公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get all mushy on me. So long, Princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.08,0:06:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.96,0:06:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了，殿下 - 我以为你决定留下呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, Your Highnessness. - I thought you had decided to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在奥德曼特遇到的那个赏金猎人让我改变了主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bounty hunter we ran into in Ord Mantell changed my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉，我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han, we need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们需要？ - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么你呢？ - 我需要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about you need? - I need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.02,0:06:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可能不吧 - 你说我该知道些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You probably don't. - What precisely am I supposed to know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.65,0:06:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧，你让我留下来完全是因为你对我的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You want me to stay because of the way you feel about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.23,0:06:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，你对我们有很大帮助，你天生就一个领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. You're a great help to us. You're a natural leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.94,0:06:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我不是说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. That's not it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.61,0:06:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.53,0:06:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说出来吧 - 你不要自我感觉太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - You're imagining things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有吗？那你跟着我干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I? Then why are you following me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怕我走了，都不和你吻别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid I'd leave without giving you a goodbye kiss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我吻一个伍基族人都不亲你 - 要吻它我可以帮你安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'd just as soon kiss a Wookiee. - I can arrange that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以好好亲它一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could use a good kiss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别责怪我，我可没叫你打开加热器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't blame me. I didn't askyou to turn on the thermal heater.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在公主的房间里我只是说我很快结冰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I merely commented that it was freezing in the princess's chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.30,0:06:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实快结冰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's supposed to be freezing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.26,0:07:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么才能把她的衣服弄干？我真的没法子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we're going to dry her clothes I really don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.81,0:07:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，快关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, switch off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.14,0:07:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么把这个拆开？我们要离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you take this apart now? I'm trying to get us out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.35,0:07:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打扰一下 - 快把它们装回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Put them back together right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.61,0:07:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能和你说句话吗？ - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Might I have a word? - What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.78,0:07:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉娅公主一直都试图通过通讯器联系你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess Leia's been trying to get you on the communicator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它关了，我不想和她说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned it off. I don't want to talk to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉娅公主在担心卢克主人，他到现在都没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess Leia is wondering about Master Luke. He hasn't come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不知道他在那里 - 我也不知道他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She doesn't know where he is. - I don't know where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人知道 - 什么意思？没人知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nobody knows where he is. - What do you mean, nobody knows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,甲板官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deck Officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 甲板官 - 对不起长官，我可以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Deck Officer. - Excuse me, sir. Might I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道天行者指挥官在哪里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where Commander Skywalker is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没看到他，可能他从南门进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen him. It's possible he came in the south entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫可能？为什么不去看一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible? Why don't you go find out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 外面快天黑了 - 是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's getting dark out there. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下，长官，我可以知道现在怎么了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir. Might I enquire what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么不？ - 奇怪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - Impossible man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来，R2，我们去找莉娅公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along, R2. Let's find Princess Leia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只在我们之间说，我认为卢克主人现在一定处在危险中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between ourselves, I think Master Luke is in considerable danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:07:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者指挥官没有从南门进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Skywalker hasn't come in the south entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 也许他忘了登记 - 不大可能 超音速战斗机准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe he forgot to check in. - Not likely. Are the speeders ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，我们没法让他们适应低温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet. We're having trouble adapting them to the cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.54,0:08:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只好骑骆驼出去了 - 外面气温急剧下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll have to go out on tauntauns. - The temperature's dropping too rapidly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，但是我的朋友就在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, and my friend's out in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的骆驼在你到达第一个标记处之前就会冻僵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your tauntaun will freeze before you reach the first marker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.05,0:08:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么，我们就在地狱再见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll see you in hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进来吧，R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must come along now, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.95,0:10:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们真的做不了什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's really nothing more we can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的关节都快结冰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my joints are freezing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么说，我们当然会再见到卢克主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say things like that. Of course we'll see Master Luke again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.34,0:10:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会好好的，你看着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he'll be quite all right. You'll see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个短路的笨小孩，他一定会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid little short circuit. He'll be quite all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，所有的巡逻部队都回来了，仍然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, all the patrols are in. Still no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有天行者或索罗的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still no contact from Skywalker or Solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.49,0:12:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉娅主人，R2说他收不到任何的信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress Leia, R2 says he's been quite unable to pick up any signals…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.71,0:12:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他承认他所能接受的范围太小，不应该放弃所有的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}although he admits that his own range is far too weak to abandon all hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.21,0:12:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,殿下，我们今晚可能不能多做什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Highness, there's nothing more we can do tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,护罩门必须要关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shield doors must be closed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.13,0:12:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关闭闸门 - 是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Close the doors. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.05,0:12:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2说生存的概率是725分之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2 says the chances of survival are 725-to-1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.40,0:12:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，大家都知道R2是会犯错误的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, R2 has been known to make mistakes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.83,0:12:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,常常\N{\fnArial\fs30}from time to time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天哪！哦，天哪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear. Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.75,0:12:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别为卢克主人担心，我肯定他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about Master Luke. I'm sure he'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很聪明，嗯，对于一个人类来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's quite clever, you know, for a human being.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.79,0:13:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,本？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.45,0:13:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要去达古巴星系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will go to the Dagobah system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.21,0:13:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,达古巴星系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dagobah system?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.08,0:13:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里，你要向尤达学习…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you will learn from Yoda…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个指导我的绝地导师\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Jedi master who instructed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.90,0:13:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这样，卢克，告诉我你没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this, Luke. Give me a sign here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时间不多了 - 本\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not much time. - Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持一下，小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.11,0:14:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,达古巴星系，达古巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dagobah system. Dagobah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.45,0:14:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能不好闻，小子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may smell bad, kid…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.49,0:14:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yoda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.54,0:14:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这会在我打开护罩之前让你保暖\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it'll keep you warm till I get the shelter up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.12,0:14:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,本，达古巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben. Dagobah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.09,0:14:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太难闻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought they smelled bad…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫总部，有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echo Base, I've got something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是很清楚，但是有可能是生命体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much, but it could be a life form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者指挥官，收到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Skywalker, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.86,0:15:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是罗格二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Rogue Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是罗格二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Rogue Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.65,0:15:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,索罗船长，收到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Solo, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.20,0:16:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者指挥官，收到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Skywalker, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.79,0:16:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是罗格二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Rogue Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,早晨好，谢谢你们来接我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Nice ofyou guys to drop by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫总部，这里是罗格二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echo Base, this is Rogue Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到他们了，重复，我找到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've found them. Repeat. I've found them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克主人，长官，看到你恢复真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Luke, sir, it's so good to see you fully functional again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你，3PO - R2也松了一口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, 3PO. - R2 expresses his relief also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.47,0:16:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉如何，小子？看起来还不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}How ya feelin', kid? You don't look so bad to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.10,0:16:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来很好，足以扯下刚达的耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look strong enough to pull the ears off a gundark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多亏了你 - 你可欠我两个人情了，小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks to you. - That's two you owe me, junior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，阁下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Your Worship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你成功了，把我多留了一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iooks like you managed to keep me around for a little while longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.69,0:17:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和这件事可没有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had nothing to do with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.69,0:17:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱肯将军觉得直到我们开启能量场以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Rieekan thinks it's dangerous for any ships to leave…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何的飞船起飞都是危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we've activated the energy field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个说法不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.87,0:17:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为，你是不想让像我这样英俊的男子走出你的视线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thinkyou just can't bear to let a gorgeous guy like me out ofyour sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知道你哪来的这些错觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where you get your delusions, laser brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑什么笑，你这个混球…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laugh it up, fuzzball…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.01,0:17:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看到我们单独在南方通道的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you didn't see us alone in the south passage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.22,0:17:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他向我表达了真情\N{\fnArial\fs30}She expressed her true feelings for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.85,0:17:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这样，你这个愚蠢的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you stuck-up, half-witted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,肮脏的混蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}scruffy-looking nerf herder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.73,0:17:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,说谁肮脏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's scruffy-lookin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是我说中了什么她才会怒成这样，对吧，小子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must have hit close to the mark to get her riled up like that, huh, kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点都不了解女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you don't know everything about women yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部人员，请到指挥中心来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headquarters personnel, report to command centre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部人员，请到指挥中心来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headquarters personnel, report to command centre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}T ake it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.97,0:18:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse us, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.31,0:18:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主，我们有客人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess, we have a visitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在12区发现有东西在东前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}We picked up something outside Zone 12 moving east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是金属 - 不是这里的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's metal. - It couldn't be one of those creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能是我们的战斗机呀 - 不，等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could be one of our speeders. - No. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.82,0:18:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到一些很微弱的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something very weak coming through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.79,0:18:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，我熟悉六百万种交流的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I am fluent in six million forms of communication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种信号不是联盟使用的，有可能是帝国的编码\N{\fnArial\fs30}This signal is not used by the Alliance. It could be an imperial code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.09,0:18:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来不太友好，楚伊，我们去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't friendly. Chewie, let's check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把罗格10号和11号传送到38号舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send Rogues 10 and 11 to Station 38.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.47,0:19:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能没剩下什么 - 那是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm afraid there's not much left. - What was it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.64,0:19:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,某种机器人，我的火力不是很猛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Droid ofsome kind. I didn't hit it that hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它肯定有自爆装置 - 是帝国的探测机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Must have had a self-destruct. - An imperial probe droid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.39,0:19:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能帝国已经发现我们在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good bet the Empire knows we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.39,0:19:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好开始撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd better start the evacuation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.61,0:19:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好开始撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd better start the evacuation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.61,0:20:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 司令官 - 什么事，上校？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Admiral. - Yes, Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们发现了些什么，长官，报告只有一部分…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we've got something, sir. The report is only a fragment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.53,0:20:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是发自一个在霍斯星系的探测机器人，就这么多线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a probe droid in the Hoth system, but it's the best lead we've had.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.54,0:20:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在银河中我们有几千个这样的探测机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have thousands of probe droids searching the galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.75,0:20:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要的是证据，不是线索 - 图像显示有生命迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want proof, not leads. - The visuals indicate life readings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不能说明什么，如果我们每个线索都深究的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could mean anything. Ifwe followed up every lead…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.21,0:20:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，长官，霍斯星系是不应该存在人类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, sir, the Hoth system is supposed to be devoid of humans forms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你发现了什么吗？ - 是的，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You found something? - Yes, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.22,0:20:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是它了，叛军就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. The rebels are there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.47,0:21:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人，有很多未标记的居住点\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord, there are so many uncharted settlements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.23,0:21:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有可能是走私犯… - 那就是系统所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It could be smugglers… - That is the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.11,0:21:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定先行者就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sure Skywalker is with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.61,0:21:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变航向，飞往霍斯星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set your course for the Hoth system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.74,0:21:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,维耶斯将军，准备好人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Veers, prepare your men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.28,0:21:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,司令官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.37,0:21:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,十组和七组将留下驾驶超音速战斗机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Groups Seven and 10 will stay behind to fly the speeders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦所有的运输机装载完毕…\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as each transport is loaded…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.59,0:21:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离控制系统就会准许发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}evacuation control will give clearance for launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.59,0:21:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，搞好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.97,0:21:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉！关掉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it off! Turn it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.10,0:21:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，要撤离T-47恐怕需要很长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, it will take quite a while to evacuate the T-47s.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.61,0:21:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些重型装置不管了，抓紧时间把小的模块装入运输机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the heavy equipment. There's time to get small modules on the transports.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.36,0:21:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保重，长官 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take care, sir. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.83,0:21:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，要保重呀，知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, take care ofyourself, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.71,0:22:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.79,0:22:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨，小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.38,0:22:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定有什么原因，到另一头检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be a reason for it. Check it at the other end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.59,0:22:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.09,0:22:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？ - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.73,0:22:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.02,0:22:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.99,0:22:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军，有一队灭星者\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, there's a fleet of Stardestroyers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.99,0:22:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,从四区的超空间飞来\N{\fnArial\fs30}coming out of hyperspace in Sector Four.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.37,0:22:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有的能量转到防护罩上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reroute all power to the energy shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.45,0:22:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,拖住他们，直到所有的运输机起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta hold them till all transports are away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.67,0:22:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备地面攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare for ground assault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.60,0:23:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么，将军？ - 舰队已经驶出光速\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it, General? - The fleet has moved out of light speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.06,0:23:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫描到一个能量场…\N{\fnArial\fs30}ComScan has detected an energy field…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.27,0:23:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在保护霍斯星系中的六号行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}protecting an area of the sixth planet of the Hoth system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.98,0:23:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个能量场很强足以抵挡任何的轰炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The field is strong enough to deflect any bombardment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.57,0:23:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军发现我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rebels are alerted to our presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.15,0:23:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥泽尔司令官已经驶出光速，但是他太接近接近星系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Ozzel came out of light speed too close to the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.37,0:23:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能想突袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}He felt surprise was wiser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.74,0:23:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙又笨又蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is as clumsy as he is stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.95,0:23:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军，调集你的人马，准备地面攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}General, prepare your troops for a surface attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.67,0:23:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,维达勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.51,0:23:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,舰队已经驶出光速，我们正准备…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fleet has moved out oflight speed, and we're preparing to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.60,0:23:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你最后一次失败了，司令官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have failed me for the last time, Admiral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.85,0:23:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 皮耶特上校 - 是，大人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain Piett. - Yes, my lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.35,0:23:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让部队在远离能量场的地方降落…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make ready to land our troops beyond their energy field…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.48,0:23:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,部署舰队，不要让任何东西逃掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and deploy the fleet so that nothing gets off the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.57,0:23:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你来指挥，皮耶特司令官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in command now, Admiral Piett.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.86,0:23:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，维达勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thankyou, Lord Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.28,0:24:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的驾驶员到北门集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}All troop carriers will assemble at the north entrance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.50,0:24:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦装载完毕，重型运输机就起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heavy transport ships will leave as soon as they're loaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.29,0:24:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,每艘战舰由两架战斗机护送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only two fighter escorts per ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.46,0:24:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,能量场只能打开很短的时间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The energy shield can only be opened for a short time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.67,0:24:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须紧随你们的运输机\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you'll have to stay very close to your transports.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.30,0:24:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,两架战斗机对付一艘灭星者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two fighters against a Stardestroyer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.51,0:24:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,离子加农炮将发射几炮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ion cannon will fire several shots…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.68,0:24:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,来保证没有任何的敌机挡住你们的去路\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make sure that any enemy ships will be out ofyour flight path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.93,0:24:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到能量场失效…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you've gotten past the energy shield…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.14,0:24:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即前往集结地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}proceed directly to the rendezvous point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.31,0:24:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.36,0:24:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.07,0:24:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,各自去自己的架舱吧，我们出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody to your stations. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.67,0:24:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的主要目标肯定是发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their primary target will be the power generators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.88,0:24:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备打开防护场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to open shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.56,0:25:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,长管，叛军的舰船在朝我们的区域飞来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, rebel ships are coming into our sector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.85,0:25:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，今天的第一笔收获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Our first catch of the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.98,0:25:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,离子炮准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by, ion control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.11,0:25:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.37,0:25:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一艘运输船已经突围\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first transport is away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.54,0:25:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一艘运输船已经突围\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first transport is away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.80,0:25:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好吗，长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling all right, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.81,0:25:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了，达克，你怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like new, Dak. How about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.81,0:25:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我觉得我一个人就可以把整个帝国掀翻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now I feel I could take on the whole Empire myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.85,0:25:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.25,0:26:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告基地，3-T8，我们发现帝国的地面部队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echo Station 3-T8. We've spotted imperial walkers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.67,0:26:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国的地面部队在北部的山脊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperial walkers on the north ridge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.24,0:26:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,57号报告总部，我们正在前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echo Station 57, we're on our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.95,0:26:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，兄弟们，要小心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, boys, keep tight now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.08,0:26:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，我没有无线电导引，我还没好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke, I have no approach vector. I'm not set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.33,0:26:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住，达克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady, Dak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.92,0:26:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动D号攻击模式，现在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attack pattern Delta. Go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.55,0:26:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.72,0:26:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍比，你在我旁边吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbie, you still with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,打不破他们的护甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That armour's too strong for blasters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗格小组，用你们的叉子，发射线缆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogue Group, use your harpoons and tow cables.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.38,0:27:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去缠它们的腿，这是我们唯一的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for the legs. It might be our only chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.93,0:27:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好，达克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by, Dak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.30,0:27:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，我们的发射控制器出了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke, we've got a malfunction in fire control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.22,0:27:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要切换到辅助设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to cut in the auxiliary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.35,0:27:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.35,0:27:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持，达克，准备好投射线缆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, Dak. Get ready to fire that tow cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.57,0:27:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,达克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dak?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.68,0:28:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，维达勋爵，我已经到达主发电机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Lord Vader. I've reached the main power generators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.72,0:28:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,护罩很快就会关闭，你可以准备登陆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shield will be down in moments. You may start your landing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.81,0:28:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗格三号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rogue Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.11,0:28:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到，罗格队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, Rogue Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.65,0:28:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,威治，我的炮手牺牲了，你要帮我来射击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wedge, I've lost my gunner. You'll have to make this shot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.74,0:28:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cover foryou.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.57,0:28:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好你的叉子，等我的下一次穿越\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set your harpoon. Follow me on the next pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.16,0:28:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，罗格队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming around, Rogue Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.96,0:28:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住，罗格二号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady, Rogue Two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.42,0:28:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射叉子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activate harpoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.46,0:28:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,射得好，简森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good shot, Janson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.01,0:28:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再绕一圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.89,0:29:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,线缆放出，让它去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cable out. Let her go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.27,0:29:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱离线缆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detach cable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.23,0:29:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,线缆脱离了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cable detached.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.24,0:29:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.71,0:29:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 成功了 - 我看到了，威治，干得好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That got him! - I see it, Wedge. Good work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.84,0:29:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为我们可以在同一时刻保护两艘运输机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we can protect two transports at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.01,0:29:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实很冒险，但是我们坚持不了太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's risky, but we can't hold out much longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.43,0:29:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.01,0:29:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发射巡逻机 - 让剩下的地面人员撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Launch patrol. - Evacuate remaining ground staff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.56,0:29:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根连那里，那根连那里，明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one goes there, that one goes there. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.23,0:29:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，现在你来照顾卢克主人了，明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, you take good care of Master Luke now, understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.53,0:29:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也要照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do take good care ofyourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.37,0:30:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天呐！哦，天那！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear. Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.69,0:30:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的部队都将登陆进行地面攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}All troops will debark for ground assault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.15,0:30:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备瞄准主发电站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare to target the main generator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.28,0:30:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 罗格二号，你还好吗？ - 嗯，我在你旁边，罗格队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rogue Two, are you all right? - Yeah. I'm with you, Rogue Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.87,0:30:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好叉子，我为你掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set harpoon. I'll cover foryou.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.29,0:30:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来了 - 注意那里的交叉火力，伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Coming around. - Watch that crossfire, boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.67,0:30:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好三号位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set for position three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.59,0:30:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.00,0:30:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,降低高度，现在发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay tight and low. This is it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.39,0:30:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍比！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.76,0:30:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被击中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been hit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.98,0:31:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？ - 你为什么还在这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right? - Why are you still here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.77,0:31:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我听到指挥中心被击中了 - 你应该离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heard the command centre had been hit. - You've got your clearance to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.90,0:31:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，我会离开的，但是首先，我必须让你登上飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I'll leave. First I'm gonna get you to your ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.44,0:31:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,殿下，我们必须上这最后一艘运输机，这是我们唯一的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Highness, we must take this last transport. It's our only hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.66,0:31:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让所有12区的部队去南坡保护战斗机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send all troops in Sector 12 to the south slope to protect the fighters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.41,0:32:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国部队已经进入基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperial troops have entered the base.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.58,0:32:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国部队已经进入基地…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperial troops have entered…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.33,0:32:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！就这样吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.33,0:32:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,发出撤离信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the evacuation code si gnal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.59,0:32:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也快上运输机\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get to your transports.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.76,0:32:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.01,0:32:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始撤退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin retreat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.55,0:32:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.16,0:33:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到发电机的距离是多少？ - 17.28\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Distance to power generators? - 17.28.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.54,0:33:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准，最大火力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target. Maximum firepower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.82,0:33:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,运输机，我是索罗，起飞吧，我过不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transport, this is Solo. Take off. I can't get to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.54,0:34:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带她去乘鹰号，快起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get her out on the Falcon. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.08,0:34:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去哪里？快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going? Come back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.64,0:34:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！等等我！停下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait for me! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.15,0:34:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是狗改不了吃屎 - 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How typical. - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.90,0:34:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来，金棒子，不然你就要被埋在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, goldenrod! You're gonna be a permanent resident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.95,0:34:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.64,0:34:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这怎么样？ - 要不要我出去推一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's this? - Would it help if I got out and pushed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.93,0:35:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 索罗船长，索罗船长 - 可以考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain Solo. Captain Solo. - It might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.44,0:35:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，我想说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, might I suggest that you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.23,0:35:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是等一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.15,0:35:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这部老爷车根本不可能冲破封锁的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bucket ofbolts will never get past that blockade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.78,0:35:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个宝贝还有几个惊喜要给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This baby's got a few surprises left in her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.00,0:35:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来！快来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.92,0:35:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动，希望不要熄火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch over. Let's hope we don't have a burnout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.97,0:35:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.72,0:35:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一点你会犯错误的，希望我当时能在场目睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someday you'll be wrong. I hope I'm there to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.89,0:35:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,按！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.12,0:35:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ｒ２\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.79,0:36:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her ready for take-off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.12,0:36:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运，卢克，集结点再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Luke. See you at the rendezvous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.76,0:36:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，R2，我们这就上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, R2. We're going. We're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.35,0:36:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没出什么问题，R2，我只是在设定新的路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing wrong, R2. I'm just setting a new course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.40,0:36:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不去和其他人集结，我们现在去达古巴星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna regroup with the others. We're going to the Dagobah system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.95,0:36:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.33,0:36:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的，我再手动操纵一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all right. I'd like to keep it on manual control for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.02,0:37:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我看到他们了！我看到他们了！ - 你看到什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw 'em! I saw 'em! - Saw what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.52,0:37:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭星者，有两架紧跟着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stardestroyers, two of'em coming right at us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.81,0:37:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官，我想说… - 让他闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, might I suggest… - Shut him up or shut him down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.40,0:37:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查变流护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the deflector shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.49,0:37:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，他们还能操纵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Well, we can still outmanoeuvre them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.87,0:37:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动躲避功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take evasive action!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.39,0:37:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备进入光速 - 长官，这不行…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Prepare to jump to light speed. - But, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.18,0:37:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们靠近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.02,0:37:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，这样吗？看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? Watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.27,0:37:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.48,0:37:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想有麻烦了 - 请让我说完，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think we're in trouble. - If I may say so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.07,0:37:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才发现超光速推进器被损毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed earlier the hyperdrive motivator has been damaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.66,0:37:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不可能进入光速了 - 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's impossible to go to light speed. - We're in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.04,0:38:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,水平推进器！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horizontal boosters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.50,0:38:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,截流闸门！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alluvial dampers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.34,0:38:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是！把氢气扳手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not it. Bring me the hydrospanner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.51,0:38:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知道怎么才能解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how we're gonna get out of this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.89,0:38:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.77,0:38:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是激光波，我们被什么东西击中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't a laser blast. Something hit us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.94,0:38:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉，快上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Han, get up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.11,0:38:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走，楚伊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Chewie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.36,0:38:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asteroids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.33,0:38:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 楚伊，设置到271 - 你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chewie, set 271. - What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.42,0:38:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要进入小行星带吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not actually going into an asteroid field?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.75,0:38:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们疯了才会跟着我们，不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd be crazy to follow us, wouldn't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.71,0:38:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用这样来引起我的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this to impress me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.76,0:38:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，在小行星群中成功行驶的概率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, the possibility of successfully navigating an asteroid field…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.05,0:38:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大约是3720分之一 - 别和我谈什么可行性\N{\fnArial\fs30}- is approximately 3, 720-to-1. - Never tell me the odds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.29,0:39:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说想看我犯错误吗？现在可能就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wanted to be around when I made a mistake. This could be it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.55,0:39:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收回那句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.30,0:39:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果再多呆一会，我们会粉身碎骨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get pulverized ifwe stay out here much longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.51,0:39:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不想和你讨论这个 - 粉身碎骨？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ain't gonna argue with that. - Pulverized?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.43,0:39:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在来靠近一个大家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going closer to one of the big ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.39,0:39:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 靠近？ - 靠近？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Closer? - Closer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.34,0:40:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直是自杀！现在无处可走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is suicide! There's nowhere to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.34,0:40:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里，看起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. That looks pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.42,0:40:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪看起来不错？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What looks pretty good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.43,0:40:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，这样就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That'll do nicely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.93,0:40:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，我们到底去哪里呀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, ma'am, but where are we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.73,0:40:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你清楚自己在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you know what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.07,0:40:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，我也希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.29,0:40:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，到了，达古巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, that's it. Dagobah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.00,0:40:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我可不想改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not gonna change my mind about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.17,0:40:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有监测到城市或是科技产物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not picking up any cities or technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.76,0:40:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有大规模的生命迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Massive life form readings though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.89,0:40:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面肯定有生物存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something alive down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.60,0:41:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧，这里不会有帝国机器人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I'm sure it's perfectly safe for droids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.19,0:41:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道！我知道！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know! I know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.03,0:41:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的探测器都失灵了，我什么都看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the scopes are dead. I can't see a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.82,0:41:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持一下，马上开始着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hang on. I'm gonna start the landing cycle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.01,0:42:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，R2，你不要动，我到周围看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, R2, you stay put. I'll have a look around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.14,0:42:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2？\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.31,0:42:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.11,0:42:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2！\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.28,0:42:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可要小心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You be more careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.87,0:42:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，那边走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.74,0:43:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2！\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.73,0:43:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.48,0:43:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.07,0:43:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能出来太走运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were lucky to get out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.36,0:43:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么坏了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything broken?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.91,0:44:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你说不该来这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ifyou're saying coming here was a bad idea…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.12,0:44:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在开始同意你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm beginning to agree with ya.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.42,0:44:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，你说我们在这里干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, what are we doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.21,0:44:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.71,0:44:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像做梦一样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}something out of a dream or…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.72,0:44:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.88,0:44:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm just going crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.30,0:44:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事，司令官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Admiral?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.80,0:44:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的舰只发现了千年鹰号，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our ships have sighted the Millennium Falcon, lord…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.01,0:44:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他进入了一个行星群，如果冒险进入…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it has entered an asteroid field, and we cannot risk…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.22,0:44:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不管什么行星群，司令官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asteroids do not concern me, Admiral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.14,0:45:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只要那艘船，不要理由 - 是，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want that ship, not excuses. - Yes, lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.82,0:45:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上关掉所有东西，除了应急供电系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna shut down everything but the emergency power systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.03,0:45:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，我想问一下，会把我关掉吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I'm almost afraid to ask, but does that include shutting me down too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.11,0:45:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我们需要你和鹰号通讯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I need you to talk to the Falcon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.28,0:45:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,查出到底超光速推动器怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}find out what's wrong with the hyperdrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.38,0:45:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，很有可能这个小行星不很稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, it's quite possible this asteroid is not entirely stable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.01,0:45:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不很稳定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not entirely stable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.01,0:45:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可要感谢你说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're here to tell us these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.18,0:45:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，把这个能干的家伙带到后面去，把它插到推进器上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, take the professor in the back and plug him into the hyperdrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.89,0:45:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时，真不知道你们人类是怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I just don't understand human behaviour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.52,0:45:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟，我只是想做好自己的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, I'm only trying to do my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.94,0:45:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.20,0:45:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请放开我 - 干吗这么兴奋？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let go, please. - Don't get excited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.61,0:45:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长，被你抱着我一点都兴奋不起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, being held by you isn't quite enough to get me excited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.45,0:46:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.41,0:46:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没空管你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't got time for anything else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.53,0:46:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好开始充电了吗？好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready for some power? Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.96,0:46:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.50,0:46:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,插到这里，好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that in there. There you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.92,0:46:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要去找尤达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now all I gotta do is find this Yoda…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.80,0:46:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他确实在这里的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he even exists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.60,0:47:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可不像绝地导师呆的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really a strange place to find a Jedi master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.98,0:47:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方让我毛骨悚然\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place gives me the creeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.74,0:47:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.45,0:47:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎又觉得有点熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's something familiar about this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.70,0:47:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.62,0:47:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我感觉… - 感觉什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I feel like… - Feel like what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.75,0:47:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉到有人监视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we're being watched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.50,0:47:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下你的武器，我可不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away put your weapon. I mean you no harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.76,0:47:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想问问你来这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am wondering, why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.14,0:47:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来找人 - 找人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm looking for someone. - Looking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.26,0:47:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这不就找到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found someone you have, I would say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.10,0:47:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.60,0:47:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我能帮你的，真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help you I can. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.86,0:47:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.69,0:47:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找一个伟大的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a great warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.53,0:47:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.24,0:48:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争可不成就伟大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wars not make one great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.88,0:48:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.71,0:48:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，那时我的午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! That's my dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.97,0:48:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能吃大块的这玩意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you get so big eating food of this kind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.81,0:48:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，朋友，我本不想在这个水坑着陆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, friend, we didn't mean to land in that puddle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.14,0:48:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能把飞船弄出来就好了，可是现在出不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ifwe could get our ship out, we would. But we can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.81,0:48:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，原来是搞不定飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, cannot get your ship out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.02,0:48:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.94,0:48:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你会把它弄断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you could have broken this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.86,0:48:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.00,0:48:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽给我添乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making a mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.55,0:48:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，把那个给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, give me that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.72,0:48:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我吧，不然我不帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine, or I will help you not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.38,0:48:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不需要你的帮助，我只要我的灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want your help. I want my lamp back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.51,0:48:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要用它走出这个肮脏的泥巴洞呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need it to get out of this slimy mud-hole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.39,0:49:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,泥巴洞？肮脏？这可是我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mud-hole? Slimy? My home this is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.40,0:49:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，给他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, let him have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.53,0:49:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的！我的！ - R2\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mine! Mine! Mine! - R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.16,0:49:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以离远一点吗，小矮人？我们还有很多事要做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you move along, little fella? We got a lot ofwork to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.62,0:49:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留下来帮你找你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay and help you I will. Find your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.71,0:49:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在找一个朋友，我在找绝地导师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not looking for a friend. I'm looking for a Jedi master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.71,0:49:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地导师，尤达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jedi master. Yoda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.22,0:49:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在找尤达 - 你认识他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You seek Yoda. - You know him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.60,0:49:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会带你去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take you to him I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.89,0:49:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，是的，但是要先吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes, but now we must eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.14,0:49:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，好吃的，来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come. Good food. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.62,0:49:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.45,0:50:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ｒ２…\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.41,0:50:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来看着营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}stay and watch after the camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.22,0:50:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我需要他的时候R2跑到哪里去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is R2 when I need him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.39,0:50:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，我不知道这艘船是从哪里学的语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I don't know where your ship learned to communicate…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.18,0:50:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它用的方言实在是太奇怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it has the most peculiar dialect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.23,0:50:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想它是想说负轴上的电源耦合器被极化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it says the power coupling on the negative axis has been polarized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.86,0:50:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你要更换一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you'll have to replace it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.40,0:50:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然会换的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, of course I'll have to replace it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.91,0:50:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里，还有楚伊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. And, Chewie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.79,0:50:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们要更换负轴电源耦合器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we better replace the negative power coupling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.85,0:51:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，阁下，我只是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Your Worship, I'm only trying to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.65,0:51:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以不要这么叫我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you please stop calling me that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.23,0:51:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, Leia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.32,0:51:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有的时候把事情弄得很糟 - 是的，确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You make it so difficult sometimes. - I do. I really do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.82,0:51:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，你也可以对我好一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be a little nicer though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.20,0:51:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,承认吧，有时你觉得我是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admit it. Sometimes you think I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.25,0:51:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时，可能吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Occasionally, maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.63,0:51:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你不表现的像个无赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you aren't acting like a scoundrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.21,0:51:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,无赖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scoundrel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.59,0:51:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the sound of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.39,0:51:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下 - 停下什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop that. - Stop what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.31,0:51:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快停下，我的手很脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop that. My hands are dirty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.60,0:51:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手也很脏，你在怕什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hands are dirty too. What are you afraid of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.89,0:51:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我怕？ - 你在发抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Afraid? - You're trembling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.98,0:51:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not trembling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.53,0:51:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢我，因为我是个无赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like me because I'm a scoundrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.11,0:51:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的生活中没有多少无赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There aren't enough scoundrels in your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.66,0:51:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实喜欢有礼貌的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I happen to like nice men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.83,0:52:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就是个有礼貌的人 - 不，你才不是呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a nice man. - No, you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.42,0:52:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.54,0:52:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我隔离了逆功率能流耦合器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've isolated the reverse power flux coupling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.67,0:52:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thankyou.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.01,0:52:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非常感谢你！ - 不用客气，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thankyou very much. - You're perfectly welcome, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.06,0:52:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,维达勋爵，那是他最后一次出现在我们的监视器上\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, Lord Vader, was the last time they appeared in any ofour scopes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.31,0:52:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到我们现在所承受的损失，他们肯定已经被消灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering the damage we've sustained, they must have been destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.36,0:52:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，上校，他们还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Captain, they're alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.78,0:52:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让所有的能动的舰船扫荡行星群，直到他们被发现为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want every ship available to sweep the asteroid field until they are found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.66,0:52:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维达勋爵 - 司令官，什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lord Vader. - Yes, Admiral. What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.08,0:52:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝要求和你通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emperor commands you to make contact with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.46,0:52:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把舰船驶离小行星带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move the ship out of the asteroid field…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.75,0:52:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要保证通话质量\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that we can send a clear transmission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.13,0:52:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.36,0:53:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事吗，我的主人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is thy bidding, my master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.19,0:53:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,“原力”中有一股很大的波动\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a great disturbance in the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.12,0:53:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have felt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.58,0:53:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有新的敌人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a new enemy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.25,0:53:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个毁灭死星的年轻的叛军\N{\fnArial\fs30}theyoung rebel who destroyed the Death Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.38,0:53:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还认为这个孩子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no doubt this boy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.63,0:53:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是安纳金天行者的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the offspring ofAnakin Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.13,0:53:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个可能吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is that possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.51,0:53:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己感觉一下吧，维达勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search your feelings, L ord Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.01,0:53:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会知道这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will know it to be true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.35,0:53:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能会毁灭我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could destroy us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.94,0:53:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是一个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.15,0:53:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比·旺帮不了他什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan can no longer help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.73,0:53:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他身上的“原力”很强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Force is strong with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.70,0:53:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,天行者的儿子决不能成为一个绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}The son ofSkywalker must not become a Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.74,0:54:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能想办法让他转变\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he could be turned…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.04,0:54:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会成为一个强大的盟友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he would become a powerful ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.92,0:54:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.50,0:54:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一大笔财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would be a great asset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.88,0:54:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,能搞定他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can it be done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.26,0:54:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要么加入我们，要么就去死，主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will join us or die, master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.87,0:54:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这很好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it's delicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.30,0:54:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不理解为什么我们不能现在去见尤达？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't understand why we can't see Yoda now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.91,0:54:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心点，对于绝地武士来说也是需要吃饭的时间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience. For the Jedi, it is time to eat as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.13,0:54:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃，吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat. Eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.96,0:54:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好烫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.06,0:55:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吃的东西，好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good food. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.14,0:55:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达离这里远吗？多久才能到他那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far away is Yoda? Will it take us long to get there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.19,0:55:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不远，尤达一点都不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not far. Yoda not far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.56,0:55:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心点，很快你就能见到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience. Soon you will be with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.74,0:55:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,根出叶，我来烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Root leaf. I cook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.24,0:55:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么想成为一个绝地武士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wish you become Jedi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.79,0:55:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想，大部分因为我的父亲吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly 'cause of my father, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.58,0:55:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲，他曾是一个强大的绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father. Powerful Jedi was he.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.17,0:55:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 强大的绝地武士 - 嘿，别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Powerful Jedi. - Oh, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.80,0:55:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么可能认识我父亲？你连我是谁都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you know my father? You don't even know who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.67,0:55:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我们在这里干什么，我们在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what I'm doing here. We're wasting our time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.60,0:55:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能教他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot teach him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.02,0:55:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个孩子根本没有耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy has no patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.18,0:55:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会学着有耐心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will learn patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.28,0:55:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他心中有太多的仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much anger in him…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.78,0:55:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他父亲一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iike his father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.74,0:55:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教导我的时候，我难道不是这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was I any different when you taught me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.83,0:55:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.75,0:56:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还没有准备好 - 尤达\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He is not ready. - Yoda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.09,0:56:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.05,0:56:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能成为一位绝地武士，本，告诉他我能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can be a Jedi. Ben, tell him I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.09,0:56:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了？你怎么知道你准备好了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready, are you? What know you ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.05,0:56:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我训练绝地武士已经有800年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For 800 years have I trained Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.14,0:56:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底该训练谁我有自己的原则\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own counsel will I keep on who is to be trained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.86,0:56:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名绝地武士必须有最强的责任心\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Jedi must have the deepest commitment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.78,0:56:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最严肃的思维\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most serious mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.61,0:56:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我观察这个人很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one a long time have I watched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.78,0:56:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他的一生中，他总是看着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All his life has he looked away…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.66,0:56:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来，远方\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the future, to the horizon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.83,0:56:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来都没有考虑过他所在的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never his mind on where he was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.71,0:56:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他该干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what he was doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.47,0:56:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adventure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.84,0:56:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excitement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.60,0:56:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名绝地武士不该渴望这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Jedi craves not these things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.81,0:57:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做事不考虑后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are reckless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.73,0:57:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也曾是这样，如果您记得的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So was I, ifyou remember.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.81,0:57:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is too old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.86,0:57:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，大到难以开始训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, too old to begin the training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.15,0:57:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我学过很多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've learned so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.91,0:57:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一旦开始，他能完成吗？ - 我不会失败的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will he finish what he begins? - I won't fail you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.71,0:57:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点都不害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.88,0:57:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以后会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.09,0:57:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.22,0:58:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官，恕我斗胆直言… - 我不想听你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, if I may venture an opinion… - I'm not interested in your opinion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.85,0:58:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.98,0:58:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪里？ - 在洞的外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Outside in the cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.65,0:58:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那，听！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is. Listen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.28,0:58:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我出去看看 - 你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going out there. - Are you crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.28,0:58:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚把这堆废铁装好，我可不想谁把它再搞坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got this bucket together. I won't let it get torn apart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.95,0:58:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，那我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm going with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.33,0:58:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想，我应该留下来守护舰船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it might be better if I stay behind and guard the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.54,0:58:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.64,0:58:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地面感觉好奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ground sure feels strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.31,0:59:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎不像是岩石\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't feel like rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.86,0:59:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,水蒸气也很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an awful lot of moisture in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.57,0:59:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，我有种不好的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I have a bad feeling about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.41,0:59:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.70,0:59:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.74,0:59:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事，没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.33,0:59:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，和我想得一样，是麦那蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what I thought… mynock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.92,0:59:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊检查一下舰船的其他部分，这玩意会粘在上面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, check the rest of the ship and make sure there are no more attached…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.17,0:59:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,还会咀嚼电缆\N{\fnArial\fs30}chewing on the power cables.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.17,0:59:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦那蝙蝠？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mynocks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.88,0:59:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入吧，我们把剩下的清理掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go inside. We'll clean them off if there are any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.27,0:59:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开！滚开！脏东西！开枪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away! Go away, beastly thing! Shoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.03,0:59:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.60,1:00:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 楚伊，快离开这里 - 帝国军还在外面呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chewie, let's get out of here! - The Empire is still out there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.14,1:00:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间讨论这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time to discuss this in committee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.15,1:00:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是在和你讨论！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not a committee!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.66,1:00:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在小行星带你不能加到光速\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't make thejump to light speed in this asteroid field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.62,1:00:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快坐下，甜心，我们要起飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down, sweetheart. We're taking off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.88,1:00:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看啊！ - 我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look! - I see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.34,1:00:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们死定了！ - 这洞要塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're doomed! - The cave is collapsing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.84,1:00:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不是洞 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is no cave. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.21,1:01:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，跑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.71,1:01:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.38,1:01:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士的力量来自于“原力”\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Jedi's strength flows from the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.84,1:01:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要小心黑暗的一面，愤怒，恐惧，好战…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But beware of the dark side. Anger, fear, aggression…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.39,1:01:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是黑暗之“原力”\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dark side of the Force are they.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.68,1:01:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,战斗中，它们会轻松的占据你的心灵，在你的身体内流淌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easily they flow, quick to join you in a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.40,1:01:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你走上了黑暗之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}If once you start down the dark path…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.73,1:01:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就将一辈子臣服于它\N{\fnArial\fs30}forever will it dominate your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.15,1:01:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会慢慢侵蚀你，好像它曾经对欧比·旺的学生做过的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consume you it will, as it did Obi-Wan's apprentice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.24,1:01:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.20,1:01:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黑暗之“原力”很强大吗？ - 不，不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is the dark side stronger? - No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.04,1:01:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是黑暗之路更快，更容易，更诱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quicker, easier, more seductive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.87,1:01:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我怎么能分清什么是好的，什么是不好的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I to know the good side from the bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.08,1:01:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.46,1:02:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你心平气和之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you are calm, at peace…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.80,1:02:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,被动防御之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}passive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.30,1:02:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个真正的绝地武士只用“原力”来获取知识和保护自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Jedi uses the Force for knowledge and defence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.60,1:02:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是用它来攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}never for attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.56,1:02:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是告诉我为什么我不能… - 别问，没有为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But tell me why I can't… - No. There is no why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.31,1:02:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天不会再教你什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing more will I teach you today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.19,1:02:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要考虑那些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear your mind of questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.26,1:02:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里好像有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something not right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.10,1:02:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到寒冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.39,1:02:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 死亡 - 那个地方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Death. - That place…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.06,1:02:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了黑暗之“原力”\N{\fnArial\fs30}is strong with the dark side of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.69,1:02:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是恶魔的领域\N{\fnArial\fs30}A domain of evil it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.07,1:03:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你一定要进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In you must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.20,1:03:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里面有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.16,1:03:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你带进去的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only what you take with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.25,1:03:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的武器…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your weapons…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.33,1:03:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will not need them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.04,1:05:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那群赏金猎人，我们不需要他们那些混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bounty hunters. We don't need their scum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.63,1:06:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 遵命，长官 - 反叛者逃不出我们的手心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, sir. - Those rebels won't escape us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.10,1:06:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，从灭星者级战舰复仇者号传来一条高优先级命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we have a priority signal from the Stardestroyer Avenger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.52,1:06:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.19,1:06:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁抓住千年鹰号，就能获得重奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be a substantial reward for the one who finds the Millennium Falcon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.11,1:06:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以采用任何手段…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are free to use any methods necessary…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.28,1:06:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要求他们是活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I want them alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.53,1:06:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能被分解\N{\fnArial\fs30}No disintegrations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.08,1:06:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如您所愿 - 维德勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As you wish. - Lord Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.20,1:06:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人，我们找到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord, we have them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.59,1:06:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地，我们总算逃出小行星带了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank goodness we're coming out of the asteroid field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.93,1:06:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们离开这里吧，准备好光速旅行了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here. Ready for light speed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.64,1:06:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,一，二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.98,1:06:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,三！\N{\fnArial\fs30}three!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.73,1:07:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.57,1:07:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,转换电路不工作，这不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transfer circuits aren't working. It's not my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.49,1:07:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 无法跳跃到光速？ - 这真不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No light speed? - It's not my fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.21,1:07:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生，我们刚刚失去了我们后部的主偏导护盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we just lost the main rear deflector shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.33,1:07:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的后舱再挨一击，我们就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more direct hit on the back quarter and we're done for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.71,1:07:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,调头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn her around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.55,1:07:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,调过头来！我要把全部能量放到前部的护盾上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn her around! I'm gonna put all power in the front shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.30,1:07:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要攻击？ - 面对帝国灭星者级战舰…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna attack? - The odds of surviving…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.43,1:07:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接攻击的存活机会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}a direct assault on an imperial Stardestroyer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.47,1:07:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.90,1:07:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们转入攻击位置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're moving to attack position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.07,1:07:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,护盾开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shields up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.74,1:07:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟踪他们，他们可能还会再来这么一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Track them. They may come around for another pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.45,1:07:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼达船长，我们的搜索屏失去那船的踪迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Needa, the ship no longer appears on our scopes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.96,1:07:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不可能凭空消失，那么小的船不可能有隐身装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't have disappeared. No ship that small has a cloaking device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.71,1:07:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是的确没有他们的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no trace of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.62,1:07:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长，维德勋爵要最新战况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, Lord Vader demands an update.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.55,1:08:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备一艘飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a shuttle ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.72,1:08:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会亲自去向维德勋爵道歉，对于追丢他们我负全责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall assume full responsibility for losing them and apologize to Lord Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.76,1:08:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是同时，继续搜寻整个区域 - 遵命，尼达船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meanwhile, continue to scan the area. - Yes, Captain Needa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.56,1:08:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,用“原力”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.94,1:08:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.57,1:08:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，提起那块石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.50,1:08:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.84,1:08:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,专心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrate!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.32,1:09:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不，我们永远出不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. We'll never get it out now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.49,1:09:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太肯定了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So certain are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.29,1:09:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always with you it cannot be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.75,1:09:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道没有听到我说的话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hearyou nothing that I say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.84,1:09:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,师父，用“原力”移动石头是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master, moving stones around is one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.05,1:09:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,而移动这是另一回事，完全不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is totally different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.01,1:09:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，没什么不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.38,1:09:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的不同就是你的意念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only different in your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.59,1:09:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须忘记你学过的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must unlearn what you have learned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.18,1:09:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧，我试试看 - 不能试\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. I'll give it a try. - Try not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.15,1:09:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.69,1:09:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}or do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.40,1:09:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有试的余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.70,1:10:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不行，它太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. It's too big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.75,1:10:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大小不是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Size matters not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.91,1:10:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我，你是不是想凭我的体格来判断我的能力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. Judge me by my size, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.67,1:10:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你不该这样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And well you should not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.67,1:10:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我有“原力”作我的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}for my ally is the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.43,1:10:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个威力无穷的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a powerful ally it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.89,1:10:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命孕育了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life creates it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.39,1:10:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它逐渐变强\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes it grow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.31,1:10:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的能量环绕着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its energy surrounds us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.15,1:10:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,约束着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and binds us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.07,1:11:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们靠的是发光体，不是这些坚硬的肌肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luminous beings are we, not this crude matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.36,1:11:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要感受你身边的“原力”\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must feel the Force around you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.49,1:11:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里，在你和我之间…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, between you, me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.95,1:11:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有树木，岩石…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the tree, the rock…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.33,1:11:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,各处\N{\fnArial\fs30}everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.54,1:11:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.09,1:11:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使在这块土地和那艘船之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}even between the land and the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.80,1:11:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要求的是无法做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.58,1:13:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.63,1:13:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你为什么会失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why you fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.57,1:13:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受你的道歉，尼达船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apology accepted, Captain Needa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.33,1:13:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德勋爵，我们已经搜索了临近区域，但是一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Vader, our ships have completed their scan and found nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.50,1:13:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果千年鹰号进入了光速飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Millennium Falcon went into light speed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.59,1:14:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它现在该出现在银河的另一边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll be on the other side of the galaxy now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.63,1:14:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让所有单位注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert all commands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.59,1:14:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据已知的他们最后的航线，计算出他们所有可能的目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calculate every possible destination along their last known trajectory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.97,1:14:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 遵命，大人，我们会找到他们的 - 不要再让我失望…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, my lord. We'll find them. - Don't fail me again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.31,1:14:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,司令官阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.48,1:14:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,布署舰队，让所有单位注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert all commands. Deploy the fleet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.79,1:14:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,索罗船长，这一次你玩过火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Solo, this time you have gone too far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.09,1:14:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我不会保持沉默的，楚贝卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not be quiet, Chewbacca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.63,1:14:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚贝卡，为什么就没人听我说呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why doesn't anyone listen to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.30,1:14:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国舰队即将分散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fleet's beginning to break up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.47,1:14:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备手动放下登陆爪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go stand by the manual release for the landing claw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.68,1:14:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在不懂这能对我们有何帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really don't see how that's going to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.81,1:14:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这种极端环境下，投降绝对是可以接受的一个方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrender is a perfectly acceptable alternative in extreme circumstances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.39,1:14:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国也许会对我们足够仁慈…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Empire may be gracious enough…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.61,1:14:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 你下一步打算怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thankyou. - What did you have in mind next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.15,1:15:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们严格按照帝国舰队规程来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they follow standard imperial procedure…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.19,1:15:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会先把垃圾扔下，然后进入光速飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll dump their garbage before they go to light speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.57,1:15:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后我们就可以慢慢漂走了 - 是啊，和一堆垃圾为伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then we just float away. - With the rest of the garbage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.70,1:15:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.24,1:15:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们得在这附件找一个安全的港口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we gotta find a safe port somewhere around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.62,1:15:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么建议吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any ideas?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.12,1:15:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在哪里？ - 阿诺亚特星系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we? - The Anoat system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.62,1:15:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿诺亚特星系，这可没几个安全港\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Anoat system. There's not much there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.34,1:15:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩，等等，真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wait. This is interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.30,1:15:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兰多 - 兰多星系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lando. - Lando system?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.30,1:15:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰多不是个星系，是个人，兰多·卡尔瑞辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lando's not a system. He's a man. Lando Calrissian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.01,1:15:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,牌手，赌徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Card player, gambler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.39,1:15:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个无赖，你会喜欢他的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A scoundrel. You'd like him. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.10,1:15:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝斯平星，有点远，不过我想我们能抵达那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bespin. It's pretty far, but I think we can make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.27,1:15:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个采矿区？ - 没错，提巴那瓦斯矿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A mining colony? - Yeah, a tibanna gas mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.19,1:15:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰多从某人手中骗来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lando conned somebody out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.45,1:15:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰多和我可是很久前就在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go back a long way, Lando and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.57,1:15:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能相信他吗？ - 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you trust him? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.37,1:15:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他对帝国也没什么好感，这个我能向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's got no love for the Empire. I can tell you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.33,1:15:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,要出发了，楚伊，准备好，分离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go, Chewie. Stand by. Detach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.18,1:16:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你终于等到这一刻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do have your moments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.59,1:16:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,垃圾不多，不过的确有一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not many of them, but you do have them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.22,1:16:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.26,1:16:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受“原力”的流动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel the Force flow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.60,1:16:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.90,1:16:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.69,1:17:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.19,1:17:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.49,1:17:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过“原力”，你会看到很多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through the Force, things you will see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.16,1:17:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去、未来，世界各地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other places. The future. The past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.74,1:17:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,逝去已久的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old friends long gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.67,1:17:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制，控制住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control, control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.26,1:17:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须学会控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must learn control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.52,1:17:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到一座云中之城\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a city in the clouds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.52,1:17:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那有你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends you have there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.77,1:17:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们正在受苦 - 你看见的是未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They were in pain. - It is the future you see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.61,1:17:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Future?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.62,1:17:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will they die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.29,1:17:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Difficult to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.50,1:18:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来总是在不停变化的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always in motion is the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.47,1:18:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotta go to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.89,1:18:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须做个决定，如何才能最好的帮助他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decide you must how to serve them best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.06,1:18:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你现在离开，你可以去帮助他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ifyou leave now, help them you could…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.02,1:18:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们为之奋斗、受苦的一切也将因此而毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you would destroy all for which they have fought and suffered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.62,1:18:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我没有降落许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't have a landing permit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.54,1:18:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找兰多·卡尔瑞辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to reach Lando Calrissian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.30,1:18:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！让我解释一下！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute! Let me explain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.55,1:18:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能偏离你现在的航线\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not deviate from yourpresent course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.63,1:18:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们脾气真差，对吧？ - 我还以为你认识这个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rather touchy, aren't they? - I thought you knew this person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.27,1:18:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是很久以前了，他肯定把那些事都忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a long time ago. I'm sure he's forgotten about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.65,1:19:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被允许在327号平台上着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission granted to land on Platform 327…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.41,1:19:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.70,1:19:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么好担心的，兰多和我很久前就认识了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to worry about. We go way back, Lando and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.70,1:19:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在担心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's worried?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.21,1:20:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人迎接我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one to meet us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.05,1:20:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.51,1:20:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢什么？ - 他们毕竟让我们着陆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What would you like? - They did let us land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.47,1:20:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说，别担心，一切都会好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, don't worry. Everything's gonna be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.31,1:20:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.69,1:20:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没有？我的朋友来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? My friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.16,1:20:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,睁大你的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your eyes open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.91,1:20:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.66,1:20:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，你这个令人作呕，阴险狡诈，无恶不作的骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, you slimy, double-crossing, no-good swindler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.88,1:20:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干了这么多事，居然还有胆子来这里啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a lot of guts coming here, after what you pulled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.60,1:20:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗，海盗朋友？见到你真高兴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doin', you old pirate? So good to see you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.19,1:20:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我从没想到还会再见到你 - 呃，他看起来很友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I never thought I'd see you again. - Well, he seems very friendly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.36,1:20:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，真友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Very friendly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.57,1:21:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.32,1:21:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,修理一下，我想你应该能帮上我的忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repairs. I thought you could help me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.45,1:21:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你对我的船做了些什么？ - 你的船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What have you done to my ship? - Your ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.20,1:21:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，记住啊，你可是正大光明的把她输给我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, remember, you lost her to me fair and square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.62,1:21:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？楚贝卡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doin', Chewbacca?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.96,1:21:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,还和这个失败者混在一起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still hanging around with this loser?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.63,1:21:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，这一位是谁啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. What have we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.47,1:21:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎，我叫兰多·卡尔瑞辛，我是这个机构的管理者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome. I'm Lando Calrissian. I'm the administrator of this facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.14,1:21:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请问你是？ - 莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And who might you be? - Leia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.18,1:21:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你，莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Leia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.64,1:21:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦，好啦，你这个油腔滑调的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. You old smoothie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.61,1:21:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生，你好，我是C-3PO，是沟通人类与机器人关系的专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, sir. I am C-3PO, human-cyborg relations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.36,1:21:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意为您… 呃，真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My facilities are at your… Well, really!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.28,1:21:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 千年鹰什么地方坏了？ - 超空间引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong with the Falcon? - Hyperdrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.78,1:21:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会让我的人修好她的 - 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get my people to work on her. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.95,1:21:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那船可是救了我好几次命呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ship saved my life quite a few times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.12,1:21:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是银河中最快的垃圾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's the fastest hunk of junk in the galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.00,1:21:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦斯矿如何？还能替你挣钱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the gas mine? Still paying off foryou?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.58,1:21:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我想的好，我们只是个小据点，没法自给自足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not as well as I'd like. We're a small outpost and not very self-sufficient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.55,1:22:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这里有各种供应问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had supply problems of every kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.76,1:22:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,人手也不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had labour difficulties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.05,1:22:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么好笑的？ - 你啊，听听你刚才说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's so funny? - You. Listen to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.43,1:22:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在像个生意人了，是个负责的领导了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like a businessman, a responsible leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.35,1:22:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会这么想啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who'd have thought that, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.35,1:22:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你让我回想起一些事情来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing you sure brings back a few things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.40,1:22:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.73,1:22:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，我现在负责多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm responsible these days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.74,1:22:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你获取成功的必要代价啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the price you pay for being successful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.66,1:22:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到个熟人真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see a familiar face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.83,1:22:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,太粗鲁了吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}How rude!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.04,1:22:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来好里面有个R2型机器人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds like an R2 unit in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.21,1:22:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜…有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if… Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.05,1:22:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}How interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.71,1:22:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？ - 哦，天啊，我非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Oh, my. I'm terribly sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.93,1:22:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是有意闯入的，请不要起身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to intrude. Please don't get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.45,1:23:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，你必须完成训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke, you must complete the training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.12,1:23:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法不去想脑中的那些影像，我必须去帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't keep the vision out of my head. I've gotta help them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.04,1:23:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must not go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.29,1:23:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是我不去的话，汉和莉娅会死的 - 你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But Han and Leia will die if I don't. - You don't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.38,1:23:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使尤达也看不清他们的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Yoda cannot see their fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.17,1:23:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我可以帮助他们，我能感觉到“原力”\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can help them. I feel the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.05,1:23:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你无法控制它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you cannot control it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.43,1:23:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在对你来说是一个非常危险的时刻…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a dangerous time foryou…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.89,1:23:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很容易就会被黑暗之“原力”所吸引\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you will be tempted by the dark side of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.02,1:23:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，是的，欧比·旺的话你总该听吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes. To Obi-Wan you listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.11,1:23:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想那个洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.65,1:23:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得你在洞中的失败吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rememberyour failure at the cave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.86,1:23:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那之后我学到了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've learned so much since then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.90,1:23:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤达师父，我保证会回来完成我已经开始的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master Yoda, I promise to return and finish what I've begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.70,1:23:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.78,1:23:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇帝要的正是你和你的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is you and your abilities the emperor wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.70,1:23:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此你的朋友才会受苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why your friends are made to suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.87,1:23:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此我才必须去帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.67,1:24:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，我不想让你也投入皇帝那边，好像当年我失去维德那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke, I don't want to lose you to the emperor the way I lost Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.13,1:24:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.59,1:24:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们必须被阻止，而所有的希望全系于你一身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stopped they must be. On this all depends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.97,1:24:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个充分训练过的绝地武士，以原力为他的同伴…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a fully trained Jedi knight, with the Force as his ally…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.56,1:24:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能制服维德和他的皇帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}will conquer Vader and his emperor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.27,1:24:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你现在结束你的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ifyou end your training now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.48,1:24:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你选择那条快而容易的捷径，如同维德当年一样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}ifyou choose the quick and easy path, as Vader did…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.90,1:24:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就将成为恶魔的代言人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will become an agent of evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.66,1:24:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,忍耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.57,1:24:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让汉和莉娅白白牺牲吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sacrifice Han and Leia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.76,1:24:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能实现他们为之而战的正义…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you honour what they fight for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.08,1:24:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.20,1:24:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你决定与维德作战，你只能自己去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ifyou choose to face Vader, you will do it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.42,1:24:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法干涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot interfere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.50,1:24:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.22,1:24:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，给转换器点火\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, fire up the converters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.39,1:24:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要屈从于仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give in to hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.48,1:24:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会将你引向黑暗之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}That leads to the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.36,1:25:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德很强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong is Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.19,1:25:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意你学过的一切，它能拯救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind what you have learned. Save you it can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.66,1:25:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.28,1:25:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我一定会回来，我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll return. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.83,1:25:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就告诉你了，他很鲁莽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you, I did. Reckless is he.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.00,1:25:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.71,1:25:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,局势更糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}matters are worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.59,1:25:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子是我们最后的希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That boy is ourlast hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.76,1:25:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，还有另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there is another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.84,1:26:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这船的修理差不多完成了，再有两三处修理，我们就大功告成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ship's almost finished. Two or three more things and we're in great shape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.26,1:26:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,越快越好，这有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner the better. Something's wrong here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.43,1:26:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人看见过3PO，也没人听说过任何他的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one has seen or knows anything about 3PO.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.60,1:26:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他失踪太久了，不可能只是迷路\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been gone too long to have gotten lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.93,1:26:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.77,1:26:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会和兰多谈谈的，看看他知道些什么不\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll talk to Lando and see what I can find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.77,1:26:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信兰多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust Lando.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.36,1:26:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛，我也不相信他，但是他是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't trust him either, but he is my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.82,1:26:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且，我们很快就要离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, we'll soon be gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.95,1:26:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备离开了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're as good as gone, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.03,1:27:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.61,1:27:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.45,1:27:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个垃圾堆找到他的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found him in a junk pile?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.58,1:27:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一团乱，楚伊，你觉得你能修好他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a mess. Chewie, you thinkyou can repair him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.29,1:27:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兰多能找到人修好他的 - 不用了，谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lando's got people that can fix him. - No, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.38,1:27:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，我打扰你们了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Am I interrupting anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.17,1:27:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.84,1:27:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look absolutely beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.97,1:27:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝对应该和我们在一起，在云中生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You truly belong here with us among the clouds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.39,1:27:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thankyou.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.98,1:27:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,想和我一起用些点心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you join me for a little refreshment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.02,1:27:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，欢迎在座的每个人都去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's invited, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.94,1:27:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个机器人出问题了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having trouble with your droid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.15,1:27:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，没问题，怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No problem. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.62,1:27:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，因为我们是个小机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, since we're a small operation…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.25,1:27:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不在帝国的管辖权限以内\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don't fall into the jurisdiction of the Empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.63,1:28:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你是矿业工会的成员了？ - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you're part of the Mining Guild? - No, not actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.30,1:28:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这个机构太小了，不引人注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our operation is small enough not to be noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.59,1:28:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样对所有人都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is advantageous for everybody…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.76,1:28:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们的顾客都不喜欢引起注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}since our customers are anxious to avoid attracting attention to themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.31,1:28:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不怕帝国会找到你，关掉你这里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you afraid the Empire's gonna find out, shut you down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.31,1:28:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这的确是个危险，而且已经困扰我们很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a danger that looms like a shadow over everything we've built.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.73,1:28:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是事情有了发展，现在我们安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But things have developed that'll ensure security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.57,1:28:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚做了笔交易，让帝国可以永远不干涉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just made a deal that'll keep the Empire out of here forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.58,1:28:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能加入我们，我们会非常荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would be honoured ifyou would join us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.26,1:28:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择，就在你来到之前，他们就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no choice. They arrived right before you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.60,1:28:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.77,1:28:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.95,1:29:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，3PO和他们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, 3PO's with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.75,1:29:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,再坚持一下，我们马上就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hang on. We're almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.39,1:30:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是对不起，我不是有意闯入的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm terribly sorry. I didn't mean to intrude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.98,1:30:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，请不要起身\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please don't get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.78,1:30:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,突击士兵？这怎么会有？我们危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stormtroopers? Here? We're in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.28,1:30:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得赶快通知其他人，哦，不！我被击中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must tell the others. Oh, no! I've been shot!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.69,1:30:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德勋爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.44,1:31:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我抓住了天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may take Captain Solo to Jabba the Hutt…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.94,1:31:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以把索罗船长交给赫特族的贾巴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}after I have Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.07,1:31:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是死了对我可没有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's no good to me dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.07,1:31:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会遭受任何永久性伤害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will not be permanently damaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.79,1:31:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德勋爵，那莉娅和那个伍基族的家伙怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Vader, what about Leia and the Wookiee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.46,1:31:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要永远留在这个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must never again leave this city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.29,1:31:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不在我们的协定之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't part of our agreement, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.89,1:31:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把汉交给这个赏金猎人也不符合约定！\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor was giving Han to this bounty hunter!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.63,1:31:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你觉得你受到了不公平对待？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you thinkyou're being treated unfairly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.30,1:31:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.43,1:31:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，要是我在这里被迫留下一群守卫可就太不幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. It would be unfortunate if I had to leave a garrison here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.39,1:31:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这交易越来越差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This deal is getting worse all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.98,1:31:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，好，真不错，我喜欢这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, that's very good. I like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.99,1:31:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在看不见了，肯定什么东西不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's not right because now I can't see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.07,1:31:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's much better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.41,1:31:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.16,1:31:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，天啊！你干了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my! What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.33,1:31:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被装反了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm backwards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.00,1:31:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个浑身跳蚤的毛球！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You flea-bitten furball!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.00,1:31:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你这种畸形生长的扫把头才会这么蠢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only an overgrown mophead like you would be stupid enough…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.27,1:32:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.50,1:32:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们干嘛要这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are they doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.04,1:32:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都不问我什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never even asked me any questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.05,1:32:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从这滚出去，兰多 - 闭嘴，听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of here, Lando. - Shut up and listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.35,1:32:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德同意把莉娅和楚伊交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vader's agreed to turn Leia and Chewie over to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.56,1:32:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只能待在这里了，但是他们是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll have to stay here, but they'll be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.56,1:32:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那汉怎么办？ - 维德已经把他交给赏金猎人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Han? - Vader's given him to the bounty hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.81,1:32:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维德想让我们都死 - 他根本就不在乎你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vader wants us all dead. - He doesn't want you at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.36,1:33:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是要抓一个叫什么天行者的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's after somebody called Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.86,1:33:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维德勋爵给他设了个陷阱 - 而我们就是诱饵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lord Vader set a trap for him. - And we're the bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.53,1:33:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他正要来这里呢 - 好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's on his way. - Perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.33,1:33:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真把我们修理的不错啊，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fixed us all real good, didn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.66,1:33:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.83,1:33:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,停！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.34,1:33:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力而为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done all I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.63,1:33:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾我没法做的更好了，但是我也有我自己的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I couldn't do better, but I got my own problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.17,1:33:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.59,1:33:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真是个英雄呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a real hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.23,1:33:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对人可真是有一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}You certainly have a way with people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.08,1:33:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这套器材是很原始…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This facility is crude…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.04,1:33:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是应该足够冷冻天行者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it should be adequate to freeze Skywalker…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.25,1:34:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他见到皇帝陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}for his journey to the emperor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.63,1:34:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德勋爵，有飞船接近了，X翼型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Vader, ship approaching, X-wing class.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.76,1:34:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，监测天行者，并允许他降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Monitor Skywalker and allow him to land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.68,1:34:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德勋爵，我们只用这套器材做过碳化冷冻，这可能会杀死他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord Vader, we only use this facility for carbon freezing. It might kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.52,1:34:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不希望陛下要的人有什么损伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not want the emperor's prize damaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.52,1:34:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先用索罗船长做实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will test it on Captain Solo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.38,1:34:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你装好了我的腿，我才不会处在这种可笑的境地呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ifyou'd attached my legs I wouldn't be in this ridiculous position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.72,1:34:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住，楚贝卡，你对我负有责任…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now remember, Chewbacca, you have a responsibility for me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.52,1:34:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以别做什么傻事\N{\fnArial\fs30}so don't do anything foolish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.32,1:35:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友，这怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on, buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.33,1:35:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将被碳化冷冻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being put into carbon freeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.54,1:35:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他死了怎么办？他对我来说值不少呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if he doesn't survive? He's worth a lot to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.17,1:35:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他死了，帝国会补偿你的损失的，把他弄进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Empire will compensate you if he dies. Put him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.51,1:35:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚贝卡，停！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewbacca, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.80,1:35:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要，楚伊，停手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Chewie, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.93,1:35:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把我们都弄死的，停啊，我还不想死呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to get us all killed! Yes, stop. I'm not ready to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.06,1:35:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！嘿！听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey! Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.14,1:35:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，这样帮不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, this won't help me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.77,1:35:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，省点力气吧，还会有其他地方需要你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, save your strength. There'll be another time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.23,1:35:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.98,1:35:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to take care of her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.99,1:35:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听见我的话了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.88,1:36:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.04,1:36:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？转过去，我看不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? Turn round. I can't see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.52,1:37:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把他碳化冷冻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've encased him in carbonite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.69,1:37:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他能撑过冷冻过程的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should be quite well-protected…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.69,1:37:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该被保护的很好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he survived the freezing process, that is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.74,1:37:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦，卡尔瑞辛，他活着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Calrissian, did he survive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.36,1:37:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，他活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.87,1:37:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且正处于完美的休眠状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in perfect hibernation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.70,1:37:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在是你的了，赏金猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all yours, bounty hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.71,1:37:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新布置一下这个房间，准备迎接天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reset the chamber for Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.83,1:37:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人，天行者刚刚着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skywalker has just landed, lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.79,1:38:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，一定要让他找来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. See to it that he finds his way in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.93,1:38:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔瑞辛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calrissian…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.93,1:38:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,把公主和那个伍基族的人带到我的船上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}take the princess and the Wookiee to my ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.47,1:38:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过他们应该要置于我的监控之下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said they'd be left under my supervision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.73,1:38:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我改变主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am altering the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.90,1:38:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,祈祷我不会再改变主意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray I don't alter it any further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.88,1:39:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，别来！是个陷阱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke, don't! It's a trap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.92,1:40:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是陷阱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a trap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.43,1:40:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿“原力”与你同在，年轻的天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Force is with you, young Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.23,1:40:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你还不是一名绝地武士\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you are not a Jedi yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.29,1:41:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.71,1:42:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们关进警卫塔，保持安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold them in the security tower. And keep it quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.63,1:42:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.76,1:42:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你以为你在干嘛？ - 我们正逃离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you thinkyou're doing? - We're getting out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.18,1:42:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就计算好了，只是出了点小错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew all along. It had to be a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.06,1:42:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为当你对汉做了这种事情以后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think that after what you did to Han…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.90,1:42:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我别无选择 - 你在干嘛？相信他吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I had no choice. - What are you doing? Trust him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.32,1:42:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们理解这一点对吧，楚伊？他别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand, don't we, Chewie? He had no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:23.45,1:42:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想帮忙而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.11,1:42:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要你的什么帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need any ofyour help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.87,1:42:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.50,1:42:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听起来他好像是说汉 - 还有机会救汉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It sounds like Han. - There's still a chance to save Han…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.05,1:42:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在东方…平台\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the east… platform.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.51,1:42:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对于所发生的一切深感抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm terribly sorry about all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:49.77,1:42:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟，他只是个伍基族人\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all, he's only a Wookiee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.48,1:42:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,把索罗船长放到货舱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put Captain Solo in the cargo hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.37,1:43:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，你去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, where have you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.75,1:43:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，转过来，你这个毛茸茸的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Turn around, you woolly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.83,1:43:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！我们正要从赏金猎人那里把汉救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! We're trying to save Han from the bounty hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.34,1:43:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，至少你还是完整的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least you're still in one piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.88,1:43:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我变成什么样子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what's happened to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.19,1:43:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不！楚伊，他们就在你后面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Chewie, they're behind you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.75,1:43:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你学到了不少啊，年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have learned much, young one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.21,1:43:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你吃惊的地方还多着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find I'm full of surprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.93,1:44:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的命运注定是和我在一起，年轻的天行者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your destiny lies with me, Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.89,1:44:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比·旺早就知道这将会成为现实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan knew this to be true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.45,1:44:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,太容易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All too easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.04,1:44:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你不如皇帝陛下想像的那么强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you're not as strong as the emperor thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.67,1:44:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.26,1:44:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,太令人感动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most impressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.56,1:44:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比·旺把你教的不错啊，你已经控制了你的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan has taught you well. You have controlled your fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.02,1:44:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在释放你的愤怒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, release your anger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.36,1:45:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你的仇恨才能摧毁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only your hatred can destroy me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.91,1:47:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全密码已经被改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The security code has been changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.96,1:47:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，快告诉计算机重设整个安全系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, you can tell the computer to override the security systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.21,1:47:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.22,1:47:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意，我是兰多·卡尔瑞辛，注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention. This is Lando Calrissian. Attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.64,1:47:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国已经控制了这个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Empire has taken control ofthe city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.72,1:47:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议在更多的帝国部队还没来的时候，每个人都迅速撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I advise everyone to leave before more imperial troops arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.07,1:47:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.82,1:47:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个，别怪我，我是个翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't blame me. I'm an interpreter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.15,1:47:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是没法知道计算机终端的能量套接字的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not supposed to know a power socket from a computer terminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.64,1:48:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对千年鹰号的超空间引擎没有兴趣，他已经被修好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not interested in the hyperdrive on the Falcon. It's fixed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.56,1:48:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快开门就好，你这个笨蛋！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just open the door, you stupid lump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.95,1:48:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未怀疑过你，太棒了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never doubted you for a second. Wonderful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.89,1:48:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很痛啊！弯腰！你这个不长心眼的…喔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurts! Bend down, you thoughtless… Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.74,1:49:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.54,1:49:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来以为那个长毛野兽就是我的葬身之地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that hairy beast would be the end of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.46,1:49:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然看的更清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I've looked better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.01,1:50:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经失败了，抵抗是没有意义的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are beaten. It is useless to resist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.81,1:50:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让你像欧比·旺一样被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let yourself be destroyed as Obi-Wan did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.12,1:50:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没有出路的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.62,1:50:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我杀掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me destroy you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.76,1:50:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不知道你的重要性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not yet realize your importance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.63,1:50:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是刚开始了解你的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have only begun to discoveryour power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.43,1:50:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.39,1:50:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会完成你的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will complete your training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.89,1:50:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们合力…\N{\fnArial\fs30}With our combined strength…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.39,1:50:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以结束这些破坏性的冲突\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can end this destructive conflict…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.44,1:50:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,给银河带来秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bring order to the galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.86,1:51:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会加入你的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never join you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.49,1:51:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你知道了黑暗之路的力量的话，你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ifyou only knew the power of the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.70,1:51:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比·旺从来没有告诉过你你父亲怎么样了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obi-Wan never told you what happened to your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.04,1:51:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他告诉我很多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.08,1:51:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对我说是你杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me you killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.71,1:51:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.35,1:51:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.14,1:51:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.89,1:51:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问你的感觉，你会知道这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search your feelings. You know it to be true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.99,1:51:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以杀死皇帝，他已经预见到这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can destroy the emperor. He has foreseen this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.24,1:51:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.25,1:51:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.08,1:51:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们父子一起统治这个银河\N{\fnArial\fs30}and together we can rule the galaxy as father and son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.01,1:52:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.52,1:52:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the only way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.96,1:53:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.22,1:53:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,本，求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.00,1:53:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.55,1:54:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须得回去 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've got to go back. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.72,1:54:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道卢克在哪里 - 那那些战斗机怎么对付？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know where Luke is. - What about those fighters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.18,1:54:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，照我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, just do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.56,1:54:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦，好啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.48,1:54:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我的灭星者级战舰做好准备，等待我抵达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert my Stardestroyer to prepare for my arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:33.08,1:54:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，有人在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, someone's up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.38,1:54:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是卢克，楚伊，放慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Luke. Chewie, slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.96,1:54:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会到他下面的，兰多，打开顶舱门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get under him. Lando, open the top hatch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.19,1:55:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，稳住，楚伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Easy, Chewie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.30,1:55:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 兰多？ - 好了，我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lando? - Okay, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.49,1:55:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，楚伊，我们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Chewie. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.49,1:56:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.08,1:56:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭星者战舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stardestroyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.71,1:56:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦，楚伊，准备好光速飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Chewie. Ready for light speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.30,1:56:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的人修好了超空间引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your people fixed the hyperdrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.46,1:56:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的坐标都输入好了，成败在此一举\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the coordinates are set. It's now or never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.93,1:56:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,按下它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punch it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.06,1:56:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉我他们修好它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me they fixed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.48,1:56:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我信任他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trusted them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.48,1:57:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的错！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my fault!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.62,1:57:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很快就将进入我们的牵引束的作用范围了，大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be in range of our tractor beam in moments, lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.37,1:57:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人破坏了千年鹰号的超空间引擎吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did your men deactivate the hyperdrive on the Millennium Falcon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.04,1:57:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的，大人 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, my lord. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.17,1:57:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备登机部队，把你的武器调整到击晕状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare the boarding party and set your weapons for stun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.92,1:57:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 遵命，大人，上尉！ - 遵命，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, my lord. Lieutenant. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.51,1:57:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,吵闹的野蛮人，为什么我们还没有进行光速飞行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noisy brute. Why don't we just go into light speed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.93,1:57:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能进行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.64,1:57:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道超空间引擎被破坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you know the hyperdrive is deactivated?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.31,1:57:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市的中心电脑告诉你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city's central computer told you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.32,1:57:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2-D2，你该知道不能相信一台陌生的计算机\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2-D2, you know better than to trust a strange computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.19,1:57:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！注意点，看你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch! Pay attention to what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.79,1:57:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.84,1:58:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子，跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.01,1:58:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.51,1:58:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你没有告诉我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.83,1:58:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,竟然是维德\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.88,1:58:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，这是你的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luke, it is your destiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.18,1:58:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么没有告诉我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.73,1:58:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让所有单位注意，准备牵引束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alert all commands. Ready for the tractor beam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.11,1:59:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，赶快回来！你还没有修完我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}R2, come back at once! You haven't finished with me yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.99,1:59:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道怎么修复超空间引擎，楚贝卡会修好它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know how to fix the hyperdrive. Chewbacca can do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:08.62,1:59:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里分成数块，你却在那里做梦自己会成英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm standing here in pieces and you're having delusions of grandeur!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.21,1:59:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然修好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.40,2:00:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卢克，我们准备起飞了 - 祝你好运，兰多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Luke, we're ready for take-off. - Good luck, Lando.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.44,2:00:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们找到赫特族的贾巴和赏金猎人，我们会通知你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we findJabba the Hutt and that bounty hunter, we'll contact you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.53,2:00:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在塔图因星上的集合点等着你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you at the rendezvous point on T atooine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.28,2:00:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主殿下，我们会找到汉的，我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess, we'll find Han. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.83,2:00:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，我等着你的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chewie, I'll be waiting foryour signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.16,2:00:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care, you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:34.00,2:00:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿“原力”与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}May the Force be with you.{\r}
